# Menu panel vs sidebar

- **Sidebar menu** = app left sider (`AppSidebar`).
- **Menu panel** = left nav **inside** the page content (Locations → Country/Township; Projects → Projects/Immunization Sessions; user-role detail sections). Same shell pattern as `location-master-page` / `user-role-detail-page`.
- Desktop menu panel width: **280px** (full width on mobile).
- When the user says **menu panel**, do **not** add a nested Ant Design SubMenu in the app sidebar. Build the in-content left panel.
